((Jay Kominek|Jay))'s hero-of-the-week for writing a paper entitled __Generating Strings at Random from a Context Free Grammar__, which solves a problem that poor ((Jay Kominek|Jay)) was wracking his brain about. Now ((Jay Kominek|Jay)) will be able to write a Lojban ((random sentence generator)) that works. Theoretically.

